  '<p class="gd-p">Every booking starts as a request. A person checks the car and the price, then sends you an offer. Nothing is charged until you approve, sign and pay.</p><ol class="gd-flow"><li><b>1</b><span>Request</span><em>You pick a car and dates</em></li><li><b>2</b><span>Offer</span><em>We confirm the price</em></li><li><b>3</b><span>Sign</span><em>The rental agreement</em></li><li><b>4</b><span>Pay</span><em>Your card is authorized</em></li><li><b>5</b><span>Verify</span><em>Licence, selfie, coverage</em></li><li><b>6</b><span>Pick up</span><em>We hand over the keys</em></li></ol><section class="gd-task" id="find-a-car-and-send-a-request-find-a-car" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Find a car</h2><p class="gd-p">Start on carmacars.ca. You do not need to sign in to look around.</p><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Go to <span class="gd-url">carmacars.ca</span> and press <b class="gd-ui">Find a car</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Add your pickup and return dates. The list then shows the cars that are free and what the whole trip costs.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Narrow the list with Filters: type, seats, transmission and daily rate.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">Open a car to see its photos, rates, what is included and its own calendar. Its car code (like CC-7F3A) is under the price: quote it when you call or chat with us, and we know the car at once.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/cars</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:1440/880"><img src="/guides/img/public-02-cars-desktop-b6cd4fb8.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1440" height="880"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:86.1%;top:4%" aria-hidden="true">1</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:11.1%;top:56.8%" aria-hidden="true">2</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:3%;top:82.3%" aria-hidden="true">3</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:34%;top:87.5%" aria-hidden="true">4</span></div></div></figure></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="find-a-car-and-send-a-request-choose-your-dates-on-the-car-page" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Choose your dates on the car page</h2><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Under Dates and price, tap your pickup date, then your return date. Hatched days are already booked.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Choose the Pickup time and the Return time.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Want it brought to you? Tick <b class="gd-ui">Deliver it to me</b> or <b class="gd-ui">Pick it up from me at the end</b>. Open Add-ons to add a baby seat, flowers, a full tank and more.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">Check Your estimate, then press <b class="gd-ui">Request to book</b>. The add-ons you chose come with you.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/cars/2015-cadillac-cts-luxury</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:1120/760"><img src="/guides/img/public-03-car-page-desktop-73be4d63.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1120" height="760"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:24.4%;top:39.7%" aria-hidden="true">1</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:12.9%;top:68.2%" aria-hidden="true">2</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:3%;top:76.2%" aria-hidden="true">3</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:97%;top:50%" aria-hidden="true">4</span></div></div></figure></div><aside class="gd-box gd-box--warn"><span class="gd-lbl">Watch out</span><div>A request does not hold the car. The car is booked only once you approve the offer, sign and pay.</div></aside></section><section class="gd-task" id="find-a-car-and-send-a-request-send-your-request" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Send your request</h2><p class="gd-p">The request has five short steps. Your answers are saved as you go, so you can come back.</p><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Step 1, Dates and delivery: check the car and tap your dates in the calendar.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Set the Pickup time and Return time. Any time, day or night, with at least 2 hours of notice.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Your request, on the right, shows the estimated total as you go.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/book/2015-cadillac-cts-luxury?from=2026-12-04&amp;to=2026-12-07&amp;tf=10:00&amp;tt=10:00</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:1440/1002"><img src="/guides/img/public-04-book-1-trip-desktop-63a3738b.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1440" height="1002"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:9.2%;top:67.1%" aria-hidden="true">1</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:15.3%;top:91%" aria-hidden="true">2</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:91.1%;top:54.7%" aria-hidden="true">3</span></div></div></figure></div><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol" start="4"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">Choose where you get the car: <b class="gd-ui">At our location</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Deliver it to an address</b> or <b class="gd-ui">At the airport</b>. Then choose where you return it.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">5</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Continue to driver details</b>.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/book/2015-cadillac-cts-luxury?from=2026-12-04&amp;to=2026-12-07&amp;tf=10:00&amp;tt=10:00</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:760/942"><img src="/guides/img/public-04-book-1-trip-desktop-befba4f6.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="760" height="942"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:5.3%;top:26.2%" aria-hidden="true">4</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:61.8%;top:93.3%" aria-hidden="true">5</span></div></div></figure></div><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol" start="6"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">6</span><div class="gd-t">Step 2, The driver: fill in your first and last name, email, mobile number and date of birth. Signed in? They are filled in from your profile, with your licence class and how we reach you: check them and change anything. A licence that has expired, or an address on file over a year old, is flagged for you to update in your profile.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">7</span><div class="gd-t">Someone else will drive too? Add them under Additional drivers (drivers you named before are one tap away). Each needs a G2 or G licence and signs the agreement.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">8</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Continue to licence</b>.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/book/2015-cadillac-cts-luxury?from=2026-12-04&amp;to=2026-12-07&amp;tf=10:00&amp;tt=10:00</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:980/1032"><img src="/guides/img/public-05-book-2-driver-desktop-7b572499.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="980" height="1032"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:30.6%;top:21.1%" aria-hidden="true">6</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:30.6%;top:64.8%" aria-hidden="true">7</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:55.6%;top:88%" aria-hidden="true">8</span></div></div></figure></div><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol" start="9"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">9</span><div class="gd-t">Step 3: choose your Licence class, for example Ontario G2.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">10</span><div class="gd-t">Choose how the car is covered: Option 1 (OPCF 27 on your own auto policy), Option 2 (rental coverage on your credit card) or Option 3 (the CarmaCars Protection Plan). You can change this any time before pickup. You may also see a link to RentalCoverage, a separate company&#39;s optional product. It is not issued or handled by CarmaCars and does not replace the option you choose here, and we may earn a commission if you buy it, at no extra cost to you.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">11</span><div class="gd-t">Choose the Booking type: Standard, or Non-refundable for 10% off with no refund.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">12</span><div class="gd-t">Add anything we should know in the notes, for example a flight number. If a body shop, a tow company or a friend sent you, type their name or the referral code from their card in Did someone refer you?.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">13</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Continue to add-ons</b>. Step 4, Add-ons: tick what you want (see Add-ons below), then press <b class="gd-ui">Review request</b>.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/book/2015-cadillac-cts-luxury?from=2026-12-04&amp;to=2026-12-07&amp;tf=10:00&amp;tt=10:00</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:760/1452"><img src="/guides/img/public-06-book-3-licence-desktop-22bb144e.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="760" height="1452"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:61.8%;top:11.2%" aria-hidden="true">9</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:92.1%;top:32.2%" aria-hidden="true">10</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:92.1%;top:50.4%" aria-hidden="true">11</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:92.1%;top:66.9%" aria-hidden="true">12</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:71.7%;top:97%" aria-hidden="true">13</span></div></div></figure></div><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol" start="14"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">14</span><div class="gd-t">Step 5, Check it and send: read every line. Use Edit beside a line to change it.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">15</span><div class="gd-t">Tick the box to confirm you are 18 or older and agree to the Terms of use and Privacy policy.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">16</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Send request</b>. Nothing is charged and no card is needed.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/book/2015-cadillac-cts-luxury?from=2026-12-04&amp;to=2026-12-07&amp;tf=10:00&amp;tt=10:00</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:760/492"><img src="/guides/img/public-07-book-4-review-desktop-005f4c0b.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="760" height="492"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:92.1%;top:24.8%" aria-hidden="true">14</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:3.9%;top:59.3%" aria-hidden="true">15</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:73.7%;top:89%" aria-hidden="true">16</span></div></div></figure></div><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--side"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol" start="17"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">17</span><div class="gd-t">The confirmation shows your request number, for example CC-10021. Keep it for any question.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">18</span><div class="gd-t">A person checks the calendar, your dates and your place, usually within 2 hours, day or night. Your offer arrives by email and in Trips.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--phone"><div class="gd-phone"><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:390/755"><img src="/guides/img/public-08-book-5-sent-phone-14a99ccf.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="390" height="755"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:32.8%;top:12.3%" aria-hidden="true">17</span></div></div></figure></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="find-a-car-and-send-a-request-upload-your-licence" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Upload your licence</h2><p class="gd-p">Right after you send your request: the front and back of your licence and a selfie holding it.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">On the Request sent page, press <b class="gd-ui">Upload your licence</b> (or open your booking and press <b class="gd-ui">Your licence</b>).</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Take each photo with your phone, or choose it. Add the licence number and expiry date if we ask: it must be valid after your return.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Rented with us before? A licence on file that is still valid is used again; nothing to upload.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">We read each photo at once. Blurry or cut off? A message asks you to take it again: do it straight away. The licence details we read are filled in for you: check them and press <b class="gd-ui">These are right</b>, or <b class="gd-ui">Change them</b>.</div></li></ol></div><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Tip</span><div>You need your licence on file to accept the offer.</div></aside></section><section class="gd-task" id="find-a-car-and-send-a-request-the-main-driver-needs-an-ontario-licence" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">The main driver needs an Ontario licence</h2><p class="gd-p">The main driver of a booking holds an Ontario licence. Drivers with a licence from elsewhere can drive as extra drivers.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">If your licence is not from Ontario, your booking shows: &quot;The main driver needs an Ontario licence. Add a driver with an Ontario licence as the main driver. You&#39;ll stay on the booking as an extra driver.&quot;</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Add main driver</b>. Enter their name, email, mobile and date of birth, then press <b class="gd-ui">Add main driver</b> again.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Upload the front and back of their licence on the same page. They get their own link to accept and sign the agreement, which names them as the main driver.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">You have an Ontario licence after all? Press <b class="gd-ui">I have an Ontario licence: upload it instead</b> and upload it.</div></li></ol></div><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Tip</span><div>Pickup waits until the main driver has an Ontario licence on file. Your own licence photos stay on the booking: our team still checks them for you as an extra driver.</div></aside></section><section class="gd-task" id="find-a-car-and-send-a-request-add-ons" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Add-ons</h2><p class="gd-p">Extras for your trip, such as a baby seat, a child or booster seat, flowers waiting in the car, a chauffeur, an umbrella, a phone charger or a full tank of gas.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">On the car page (under Add-ons) or in step 4 of the request, tick an add-on or use + and − for seats. The estimate shows the price at once.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Each add-on shows its price: a trip, a day (with the most for a trip) or an hour. HST is added.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Some need notice, for example flowers need 24 hours. Seats and other items show how many are left for your dates.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">A chauffeur is confirmed by our team in your offer.</div></li></ol></div><p class="gd-p">With a full tank of gas (prepaid) you can return the car at any fuel level, with no fuel charge.</p></section><section class="gd-task" id="find-a-car-and-send-a-request-a-discount-code" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">A discount code</h2><p class="gd-p">A code from a game on the site, an offer we sent you, or from our team.</p><ul class="gd-ul"><li>On the last step of your request, type it in the promo code box. The price shows the discount at once.</li><li>Every code has a last day. You find it in the email or text that brought the code, and under Your discount codes on Your trips.</li><li>If you have not used a code, we remind you 3 days before its last day and the day before, by email and text as you chose in Profile. A code you won in a game is always reminded; a reminder of an offer comes only if you agreed to get offers, and every email has an Unsubscribe link.</li><li>A code that ended is refused with &quot;This code has expired&quot;. You can still send the request without it.</li></ul></section><section class="gd-task" id="find-a-car-and-send-a-request-ask-in-the-chat" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Ask in the chat</h2><p class="gd-p">The chat button sits in the corner of every page.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Press it and write your question: a car, your dates, the price, how booking works. The CarmaCars assistant answers right away with prices from our booking system.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Want a person? Press <b class="gd-ui">Talk to a person</b>. When our team is away, leave your name and email or phone with <b class="gd-ui">Send my details</b> and tick &quot;Email me a copy of this chat&quot;.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">End chat</b> when you are done. If you gave your email, a copy of the chat arrives by email.</div></li></ol></div><p class="gd-p">A price in the chat is for the dates you asked. Nothing is booked until you approve an offer, sign and pay.</p></section><section class="gd-task" id="find-a-car-and-send-a-request-carry-on-later" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Carry on later</h2><ul class="gd-ul"><li>Your name, email and mobile number are saved as you type them, so nothing is lost if you stop. We open an account for you with that email.</li><li>Every form that saves as you type says so under it: &quot;Saved as you type so you can pick up where you left off.&quot;, with a link to the privacy policy.</li><li>On the same phone or computer, open <span class="gd-url">carmacars.ca/account</span> (or the request page again) to carry on, no password needed.</li><li>We send you one email, &quot;Continue your request&quot;. One tap signs you in, confirms your email and opens your request on any device. You need it before you can accept an offer, sign or pay.</li><li>Already have an account? The form says &quot;You have an account: we sent you a sign-in link&quot;.</li></ul><p class="gd-p"><b class="gd-ui">Search:</b> the <b class="gd-ui">Search</b> button at the top of every page finds cars, places, help and, once you are signed in, your own bookings by number or car.</p></section><section class="gd-task" id="find-a-car-and-send-a-request-book-instantly-when-you-have-rented-with-us" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Book instantly when you have rented with us</h2><p class="gd-p">After a completed rental, with your licence verified and nothing owing, you can book an available car instantly: you go straight to sign and pay, without waiting for an offer.</p></section><section class="gd-task" id="find-a-car-and-send-a-request-book-again-instantly-and-coverage-release-35" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Book again instantly, and coverage (release 35)</h2><ul class="gd-ul"><li>Rented with us before and verified? Book an available car instantly: sign and pay at once, with no wait for an offer. Your next request goes to the person who helped you last time.</li><li>Pick your credit card from the list to see at once whether it covers the car. If it does not, use your own policy (OPCF 27: send the pink slip and the endorsement page) or the Protection Plan.</li><li>Delivery is priced by distance, with the first kilometres included, shown in your estimate.</li></ul></section><section class="gd-task" id="find-a-car-and-send-a-request-photos-and-filters-release-48" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Photos and filters (release 48)</h2><ul class="gd-ul"><li>The first photos of a car are studio photos made from that car&#39;s own photos, so every car is shown the same way. The page says so above the photos. Tap <b class="gd-ui">See its real photos</b> to jump to the car&#39;s own photos.</li><li>The <b class="gd-ui">Model</b> filter lists one model per family, for example <b class="gd-ui">CLA-Class</b> or <b class="gd-ui">3 Series</b>. The exact version (such as CLA250 4MATIC) is shown on each car.</li><li>Moving parts of the site, such as cars driving off their cards, can be stopped: choose <b class="gd-ui">Pause animations</b> at the bottom of any page.</li></ul></section>');
select app.guide_release_section('owner', 'home-and-your-vehicles', 'chapter', 'apply-and-get-your-car-listed', 'Home tells you what to do next. Each car has its own page with its status, terms, bookings, invoices and photos.

## Home at a glance

1. The menu: Home, Cars (your cars and their bookings), Money (statements, payouts and invoices), Documents and Account (profile, banking and notifications). Each of Cars, Money and Account is one page with a row of tabs on top. Home starts with the next thing to do, then one line with what you earned so far this month, how many cars are out, the next payout and any fees due.
2. At the top: each car with its photo and its status right now (On rent, Available or In service), this month''s rental charges against last month, the next payout and the days rented this month.
3. Your earnings: a column per month. Press a month, or the arrows, for its bookings, days rented, rental charges, fees billed and the payout on its statement. Choose a car to see it alone, or **Payouts** for the statement amounts. Beside it, Money (what is due now, your fees each month, the next billing date and the next payout date) and Coming up, your next bookings.
4. Your vehicles: each car with this month so far, its next booking and what it needs next. Got another car? Press **Add a vehicle**.

![](/guides/img/owner-01-home-desktop-9035b084.jpg "desktop; size: 1440 1270; address: carmacars.ca/owner; pins: 1 19.1 8.1, 2 72.9 30.7, 3 31.2 85.0")

> Tip: When something needs you (a signature, a payment or an upload), it is the first thing on Home.

## A car''s page

Open Cars, then a car.

1. The top shows the car''s photo, its plate, how it is enrolled and its status right now.
2. Terms: the Insurance Fee, the Revenue Share, your enrolment date and a link to the listing.
3. This car by month (choose a month with the arrows or its column), Coming up, and Bookings with every trip in your car. **Book it for myself** reserves it for you.
4. Leaving explains the exit notice and has the button to give it.

![](/guides/img/owner-03-vehicle-desktop-7f1a9a38.jpg "desktop; size: 1440 1242; address: carmacars.ca/owner/vehicles/1f21c3e5-39c3-4d54-ae0d-cbb2512835e7; pins: 1 55.6 25.1, 2 83.3 38.0, 3 36.5 54.5, 4 81.2 67.0")

While a car is being set up, its page also shows the **Onboarding** checklist and the uploads it still needs: the ownership permit, the lender''s permission and the insurance.

## Where your car is

Once your car has its tracker, its page shows **Where your car is**: moving or parked, when it last reported, and **Open on the map**. Below it, the trips of the last 30 days: when, how far, and where each started and ended.

1. Open **Cars** and the car.
2. No tracker on the car yet? It says **No tracker yet**.
3. You see the location and the trips only. The renter''s name and the booking stay private, as before.

## The onboarding checklist

Home and each car''s page show the same **Onboarding checklist**. Each step says one of four things: done, to do (and who it waits on: you, CarmaCars, or another office such as the registry), blocked (and why, for example "First: terms approved"), or not needed. A step that waits on you has one button: the one thing to do for it, such as **Check and sign** or **Upload the ownership permit**.

## Change an onboarding photo

A wrong ownership permit, insurance slip or lender''s letter? Open the car, then **Your onboarding photos**.

1. Press **Replace** and choose the new photo or PDF. The new one is checked again by CarmaCars, even if the old one was approved.
2. Or press **Remove**, then **Remove the photo**.

> Good to know: Every change is kept in our history. CarmaCars staff can replace or remove a photo for you too.

## Add several cars at once

Open **Cars**, then **Add cars from a VIN list**.

1. Paste the VINs (one a line), or upload a CSV or text file. Up to 50 at a time.
2. Press **Preview**: each VIN is read (year, make and model). A typo (the check digit does not match), a car already with us or one listed twice is shown and not added.
3. Say for each car whether it is owned outright, financed or leased (with the lender), then press **Add**.

Each car then waits for us to approve its terms, like any new car.

## Service and maintenance

On a car''s page, under Service and maintenance.

- What is due on your car (oil change, tires, brakes, inspections, the registration) and the tires on it.
- Every service we recorded: the date, the odometer, the shop, what was done and who paid.
- You pay for maintenance and routine wear (your agreement, 11.1). A service we paid for shows its amount and is deducted on your next statement as an owner cost.
- It is read only: call or message us about a service.

## Take new listing photos

Good photos get more bookings. You can shoot them yourself with your phone.

1. On the car''s page, press **Add listing photos** (or **Take new photos** for a car already live).
2. Read the tips for each shot: daylight, a plain background, the phone held landscape.
3. Press **Take photo** for each shot in the list. Press **Retake** if one is not right.
4. The bar shows how many required photos you have.
5. Press **Submit for listing**. New photos replace the current ones once our team approves them.

![](/guides/img/field-06-photo-shoot-capture-phone-d0b13740.jpg "phone; size: 390 610; pins: 4 92.3 43.4, 3 76.9 70.2")

## Price limits

Choose the lowest and the highest daily rate your cars are rented at.

1. **Cars**, **Price limits for every car**, at the bottom: type a **Minimum a day** and a **Maximum a day** in dollars, or leave one empty for no limit. Press **Save price limits**.
2. One car different? Open it: **Price limits** has the same two fields for that car only. Empty there, your limits for every car apply.
3. Short-notice and booked-ahead pricing, promo codes, discounts and our offers keep the rental a day between them; fees, add-ons and tax are not counted. Only a CarmaCars Admin can make an exception on one booking, and it is recorded.

## Pickup and return records, cars you referred (release 28)

On a car''s page, **Pickup from owner and return to owner** shows the car''s condition when we picked it up from you and when we gave it back: the photos, km and fuel. If you referred another owner, **Cars** > **Cars you referred** shows their cars'' bookings, use and revenue, read only, and your referral share is a line on your statements.', 'Home and your vehicles', 'What Home shows, each car''s page, adding a car and new listing photos.',
  'Home tells you what to do next. Each car has its own page with its status, terms, bookings, invoices and photos.

## Home at a glance

1. The menu: Home, Cars (your cars and their bookings), Money (statements, payouts and invoices), Documents and Account (profile, banking and notifications). Each of Cars, Money and Account is one page with a row of tabs on top. Home starts with the next thing to do, then one line with what you earned so far this month, how many cars are out, the next payout and any fees due.
2. At the top: each car with its photo and its status right now (On rent, Available or In service), this month''s rental charges against last month, the next payout and the days rented this month.
3. Your earnings: a column per month. Press a month, or the arrows, for its bookings, days rented, rental charges, fees billed and the payout on its statement. Choose a car to see it alone, or **Payouts** for the statement amounts. Beside it, Money (what is due now, your fees each month, the next billing date and the next payout date) and Coming up, your next bookings.
4. Your vehicles: each car with this month so far, its next booking and what it needs next. Got another car? Press **Add a vehicle**.

![](/guides/img/owner-01-home-desktop-9035b084.jpg "desktop; size: 1440 1270; address: carmacars.ca/owner; pins: 1 19.1 8.1, 2 72.9 30.7, 3 31.2 85.0")

> Tip: When something needs you (a signature, a payment or an upload), it is the first thing on Home.

## A car''s page

Open Cars, then a car.

1. The top shows the car''s photo, its plate, how it is enrolled and its status right now.
2. Terms: the Insurance Fee, the Revenue Share, your enrolment date and a link to the listing.
3. This car by month (choose a month with the arrows or its column), Coming up, and Bookings with every trip in your car. **Book it for myself** reserves it for you.
4. Leaving explains the exit notice and has the button to give it.

![](/guides/img/owner-03-vehicle-desktop-7f1a9a38.jpg "desktop; size: 1440 1242; address: carmacars.ca/owner/vehicles/1f21c3e5-39c3-4d54-ae0d-cbb2512835e7; pins: 1 55.6 25.1, 2 83.3 38.0, 3 36.5 54.5, 4 81.2 67.0")

While a car is being set up, its page also shows the **Onboarding** checklist and the uploads it still needs: the ownership permit, the lender''s permission and the insurance.

## Where your car is

Once your car has its tracker, its page shows **Where your car is**: moving or parked, when it last reported, and **Open on the map**. Below it, the trips of the last 30 days: when, how far, and where each started and ended.

1. Open **Cars** and the car.
2. No tracker on the car yet? It says **No tracker yet**.
3. You see the location and the trips only. The renter''s name and the booking stay private, as before.

